 "helius_rps_na_paket": 0,
 "zachem": "Slovo vladelca 10.10: istoriyu srazu na 60 sutok (22.07 .. 20.09), ne dozhidayas itoga po 30 -- nachalo sovpadaet s BOOST (21.07), glubzhe drugoy rynok. Marker zadacha_glubina30 uzhe zakazal sutki 22.08..20.09; zdes ostalnye 31 -- 22.07..21.08. Parametry te zhe, chto u prezhnih paket_* faylov: porog signala 2 SOL, okno 160 slotov, bilety 0.1 i 0.3, okno dokupki 1800, pered 10, plus --vselennaya 20. Chas vesit 0.467 GB i chitaetsya na 20.8 MB/s -- 9 minut na sutki, to est eti 31 sutok eto 347 GB prokachki i okolo 4.7 chasa chteniya, kotorye idut po shest zadaniy odnovremenno (shest voln). Arhiv na etu glubinu est: proba 2026/07/23 dala 200 i 310 MB. Pereschyot istochnikov po standartu idyot promezhutochno na 48 sutkah (30 + 18) i okonchatelno na 78. Tolko chtenie arhiva. Oba markera glubiny idut odnim kommitom: inache push vtorogo otmenyaet ozhidayuschiy prohod pervogo."
